1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,347
As Uke comes to strike the center of your head,

2
00:00:02,348 --> 00:00:04,521
raise both arms controlling the strike

3
00:00:04,522 --> 00:00:06,286
turn your hips to break his balance,

4
00:00:06,287 --> 00:00:08,090
slide your hand around his wrist,

5
00:00:08,091 --> 00:00:09,967
step in deeply and cut down

6
00:00:11,968 --> 00:00:15,896
as you bring Uke down in front of you,
place his shoulder in between your knees,

7
00:00:15,897 --> 00:00:18,200
and step around the front,

8
00:00:18,201 --> 00:00:19,017
controlling his arm,

9
00:00:19,418 --> 00:00:21,310
keeping it close towards your body,

10
00:00:21,311 --> 00:00:24,212
turn your body towards his head for the pin.

